+# recipe (bs): two switchable PipeSpec overhead cuts, both off
+# unless set (unset = the base file's behaviour):
+#  CMP_BS_RXLATE=1   (with pp_utils.py) PP ranks 1..PP-2 post chunk A's
+#                    broadcast receive after chunk B's forward; this file only
+#                    adds the flush for a chunk A that no chunk B follows.
+#  CMP_BS_P1EARLY=1  last PP rank, dropped chunk B: the dropped-chunk message
+#                    and P1 are sent from execute_model of step B right after
+#                    the drop decision, and the P2 draft chain (three chain
